	"descriptionMarkdown": "This platform is designed for producing white science and is built for flexible deployment across the inner planets.\n\nOperation:\nAfter construction, allow the fusion reactors to fully spin up.\nOnce the power supply is stable, the fluoroketone supply can be disabled.\n\nRecommended:\nRemove the assembler that empties the fluoroketone barrels to eliminate unnecessary logistics and resource consumption.\n\nDeployment:\nAfter being built on Nauvis, the platform is ready to travel to any inner planet.\nOptional components that can be removed: Thruster, 3 lower laboratories\n\nI run my white science production on Vulcanus.\n\n\nAdditional Output\nThe platform can also supply the Planet with the following resources:\n* Ice\n* Calcite\n* Carbon\n* Sulfur\n* Copper ore\n* Iron ore",
